          "docs": "OpenAI-compatible chat completions through the Keywords AI gateway. Routes to 250+ models behind a single endpoint, with optional streaming (Server-Sent Events when `stream` is true), tool calling, structured outputs, fallbacks, load balancing, caching, and automatic logging."
